{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0206_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "4ff51de496e3c9c4364fe9e9e45ffdf9b698b9a83b19837d956125b3604a7a2b", "ja": "社長さんと音無先輩に\n焼きイモもらっちゃった♪\n甘くておいしかったなぁ～。", "zh": "从社长和音无前辈那里\n得到了烤红薯♪\n又甜又好吃呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0206_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "9a2bbf02e38379910cb5e13efc93838bab395a83d6861c40758d05f29c021a89", "ja": "やっぱり、秋は焼きイモだよね。\nでも、一度にふたつは、\n食べすぎだったかも……？", "zh": "秋天果然还是得吃烤白薯呢。\n不过，一次吃两个，\n可能有点吃太多了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0206_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "415e3f91061026f3280176d7e3f94b1dcd668e3579024a51feaf6c2b9fb37957", "ja": "う、ううん、きっと大丈夫！\n食べちゃったぶん運動すれば、\nプラマイゼロだから！", "zh": "不、不，肯定没问题！\n把吃掉的那份运动回来，\n这样就能抵消啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0206_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "6c7556413f2f09d92b23a35d06e9064f110737da3ca9df674dc604dfd8407838", "ja": "よーし！　ちょっとだけ\nウォーキングしちゃおうかな。\n…イチ、ニー。イチ、ニ～♪", "zh": "好～嘞！稍微去\n散散步好了。\n……一、二。一、二～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
